      <p>The most common garage door failure—and one that leaves your door completely stuck. Springs tend to go without warning, often on the coldest morning of the year. We carry high-cycle replacement springs, replace both at once so you're not back in this situation in a few months, and balance the door before we leave. Most Alma spring jobs are completed same-day.</p>
    </a>

